<div class="grid grid--2-8-2 ">
  <div class="cell">
    
<div class="article-intro">
  <a class="article-anchor" id="intro-exchanging-a-foreign-driving-licence" data-label="Intro"></a>
    <h1 class="article-intro__title ">
    Exchanging a foreign driving licence
  </h1>

  <div class="page-intro rte">
    
    <p>Do you have a foreign driving licence and do you live in the Netherlands? In the Netherlands you will be allowed a limited period for <a href="/en/driving-licence/foreign-driving-licence/driving-with-a-foreign-driving-licence" class="anchor--internal-link">driving with a foreign driving licence</a>. After that, you must exchange the driving licence through your municipality. If it&rsquo;s possible will depend on the country that issued the driving licence. You can always exchange a valid <span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden." title="Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden.">      EU      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>/<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland." title="Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland.">      EFTA      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span> driving licence.</p>
  </div>

</div>
    

  <div class="blocks blocks--10  blocks--solid">
    <div class="block">
      
  <div class="rte" >
    <h2>Conditions for exchange</h2>
<p><strong>Please note! You must meet all the conditions.</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>You have a valid driving licence from the <span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden." title="Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden.">      EU      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>/<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland." title="Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland.">      EFTA      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span> or from a country with which we have <a href="/en/driving-licence/foreign-driving-licence/exchanging-a-foreign-driving-licence?u=dd2f1942-dd6f-4529-ab9f-d60eb54727ec" class="anchor--internal-link">an agreement</a>. An EU/EFTA driving licence is allowed to be expired.</li>
    <li>You are registered in the <span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;The Personal Records Database (BRP) contains personal data of everyone who lives or has lived in the Netherlands, stays in the Netherlands or has dealings with Dutch authorities. The municipality collects, registers and administrates the data in the BRP. Some information you must pass on to the municipality yourself, for example if you move address or get married." title="The Personal Records Database (BRP) contains personal data of everyone who lives or has lived in the Netherlands, stays in the Netherlands or has dealings with Dutch authorities. The municipality collects, registers and administrates the data in the BRP. Some information you must pass on to the municipality yourself, for example if you move address or get married.">      Personal Records Database (BRP)      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>.</li>
    <li>You have an EU/EFTA nationality. Not? In that case:
    <ul>
        <li>you have a temporary or permanent residence permit (exchanging is not possible if you are waiting for a (new) residence permit), or</li>
        <li>you are in the Netherlands under <a href="https://ind.nl/nl/turkse-burgers-en-wonen-in-nederland" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: Association Decision 1/80 of the EEC/Turkey Association Council"><span class="link__title">Association Decision 1/80 of the EEC/Turkey Association Council</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a>, or</li>
        <li>you fall under the <a href="https://ind.nl/nl/oekraine/richtlijn-tijdelijke-bescherming-oekraine" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: Temporary Protection Directive"><span class="link__title">Temporary Protection Directive</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a> (residence permit 46).<br>
        <br>
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
    </p>
    <p class="message message__inline message__info" role="alert" aria-hidden="false"><strong>Expat scheme</strong><br>
    Are you in the Netherlands for work (highly skilled migrant) and does the expat scheme apply to you? Then you can exchange your driving licence (from any country). Read more in <a href="https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/en/individuals/content/coming-to-work-in-the-netherlands-30-percent-facility" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: if you are in the Netherlands for work"><span class="link__title">if you are in the Netherlands for work</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a>.&nbsp;</p>
    <p>&nbsp;</p>
    </li>
</ul>
  </div>

    </div>
    <div class="block">
      
    </div>
    <div class="block">
      
    </div>
    <div class="block">
      
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="panel-group panel-group--default">
    


  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-dd2f1942-dd6f-4529-ab9f-d60eb54727ec"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Check if your driving licence is suitable
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-dd2f1942-dd6f-4529-ab9f-d60eb54727ec"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>Is your driving licence not from an EU/EFTA country? Then check the list of countries below. Do you have a driving licence&nbsp;from a country that is not on the list, for example a driving licence from America, and you don't apply to <a href="https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/en/individuals/content/coming-to-work-in-the-netherlands-30-percent-facility" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: the expat scheme"><span class="link__title">the expat scheme</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a>? Then you cannot exchange.
</p>
<p>
</p>
<p class="message message__inline message__info" role="alert" aria-hidden="false">You must also have lived in the country for 185 days in the year you obtained the licence. Only then can you exchange if you have a driving licence that is not from an EU/EFTA country.&nbsp;</p>
<h3>Driving licences from countries outside the EU/EFTA that can be exchanged</h3>
<p>You will get the licence&nbsp;category listed below.&nbsp;Do you have a driving licence from a country that is not on the list, for example a driving licence from America, and you don't apply to <a href="https://www.belastingdienst.nl/wps/wcm/connect/en/individuals/content/coming-to-work-in-the-netherlands-30-percent-facility" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: the expat scheme"><span class="link__title">the expat scheme</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a>? Then exchange is not possible.</p>
<div class="table__wrapper js-resizing-table">
<table class="table__simple">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th scope="col">Country</th>
            <th scope="col">Category</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>Andorra
            </td>
            <td><span style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Roboto;">Category B (passenger car)</span>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Canadian province of Alberta
            </td>
            <td>Category B (class 5, passenger car)
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Canadian province of Qu&eacute;bec
            </td>
            <td>Category B (class 5, passenger car)
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Gibraltar
            </td>
            <td>All categories</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Great Britain</td>
            <td>All categories&nbsp;(the BE category only if you have taken a separate exam for this)<br>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Guernsey</td>
            <td>All categories</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Isle of Man</td>
            <td>All categories&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Israel</td>
            <td>Category B (passenger car)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Japan
            </td>
            <td>Categories A and B (1B, passenger cars and motorcycles with cylinder capacities of more than 400 cm3)
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Jersey
            </td>
            <td>All categories</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Monaco
            </td>
            <td>All categories<br>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>North Ireland</td>
            <td>All categories</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Singapore
            </td>
            <td>Category A (class 2, motorcycles with cylinder capacities of more than 400 cc), category B (class 3, passenger car)&nbsp;
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Chinese Taipei (Taiwan)</td>
            <td>Category B (passenger car)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Former Netherlands Antilles<br>
            (Aruba, Bonaire, Curacao, Saba, Sint Eustatius and Sint Maarten)
            </td>
            <td>All categories</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>South Korea
            </td>
            <td>Category B (1st and 2nd class ordinary licence)
            </td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4>
<br>
Previously held a Dutch driving licence?
</h4>
<p>Do you have a driving licence&nbsp;from a country that has no agreement with the Netherlands? But have you had a Dutch driving licence&nbsp;in the past that was valid after June 30, 1985? If so, it is possible to exchange your driving licence. You will then get the same categories you had on your Dutch driving licence.</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>



  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-efa644ea-23f8-4cca-8487-43fc76085bf2"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Exchanging possible? Please visit your municipality
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-efa644ea-23f8-4cca-8487-43fc76085bf2"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p class="message message__inline message__warning" role="alert" aria-hidden="false"><strong>Start before your driving licence expires</strong><br>
If your driving licence from outside the EU/EEA is about to expire, start the exchange process at your local council. We cannot exchange an expired driving licence. Additional documents, such as a health declaration from the CBR, can be submitted later.</p>
<ol>
    <li style="margin-left: 40px;">Does the checklist reveal that you can indeed exchange your foreign driving licence? Please visit your municipality and bring the following:
    <ul>
        <li style="margin-left: 40px;">A colour passport photo. Check the <a href="https://www.rijksoverheid.nl/documenten/brochures/2020/03/23/fotomatrix-2020" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: requirements"><span class="link__title">requirements</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">.</span></li>
        <li style="margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">&nbsp;</span>Your foreign driving licence. Does your licence contain characters that are not used in the Netherlands, such as in Japanese or Greek? Have the licence translated by a certified translator, the embassy or the consulate.</li>
        <li style="margin-left: 40px;">An old Dutch driving licence, if you have one.</li>
        <li style="margin-left: 40px;">A valid Decision on the Evidence Rule from the Dutch tax authority if you are working in the Netherlands and hold a driving licence from outside the EU or EFTA.</li>
        <li style="margin-left: 40px;">A Health Declaration Form from the CBR if you have a driving licence from outside the EU/EFTA. You may need one for licences from within the EU/EFTA as well. For more information, please visit the <a href="https://www.cbr.nl/nl/rijden-en-uw-gezondheid/moet-ik-een-gezondheidsverklaring-invullen" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: CBR&rsquo;s website"><span class="link__title">CBR&rsquo;s website</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">.&nbsp;</span></li>
    </ul>
    </li>
    <li style="margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">&nbsp;</span>Fill out the application form at the municipality and pay the fee. The fee may vary per municipality.</li>
    <li style="margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;"></span><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">Your municipality will forward the application and all the documentation to us. Only the municipality can submit the application.</span></li>
    <li style="margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">&nbsp;</span>Everything in order? You will receive a letter within 15 working days to inform you that you can pick up your Dutch driving licence at your municipality after 5 working days. If any of the required information is missing, we will inform you in writing as well. This will delay the exchange of your driving licence.</li>
    <li style="margin-left: 40px;">You will not get your licence back.</li>
</ol>
<h3>Expired driving licence from Iceland, Liechtenstein or Switzerland</h3>
<p>Do you have an expired driving licence from Iceland, Liechtenstein or Switzerland? Please bring an original statement from the issuing authority stating that they have no objection to the issuance of a Dutch driving licence.</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>



  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-bc0b4abf-5e82-4dd0-960e-aebfb421d73b"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        If exchanging your licence is not possible
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-bc0b4abf-5e82-4dd0-960e-aebfb421d73b"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>If you are unable to exchange your foreign driving licence for a Dutch one, you will need to take both the theory and practical tests at <a href="https://www.cbr.nl/" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: the CBR"><span class="link__title">the CBR</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a> in order to obtain a Dutch driving licence.</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>



  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-8c6123bc-3482-4b9c-8a7e-d2c5c7765193"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Driving without a licence during the exchange
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-8c6123bc-3482-4b9c-8a7e-d2c5c7765193"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>Whether or not you continue to drive during the exchange process, is up to you. You are allowed to operate a vehicle if you have a valid driving licence. If the police stops you while driving, you must be able to present your driving licence. The police may fine you if you cannot comply. The risk of getting stopped by the police is slim as long as you keep to the traffic rules. If you are stopped nonetheless, for example during a roadside check, the police can contact us to verify whether you have submitted an application for exchange and whether you have handed in a valid driving licence. The risk of getting a fine is therefore small, but present. It is up to you to decide whether or not you want to run this risk.</p>
<p>The <a href="https://www2.om.nl/boetebase" target="_blank" title="this link opens in a new window" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: Fine Database"><span class="link__title">Fine Database</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a> of the Public Prosecutor (OM) states the amount of the fine for failing to produce a driving licence.</p>
<h3>Bring your passport or ID</h3>
<p>Should you decide to drive, be sure to bring a document that proves who you are (identification), such as a passport or ID.</p>
<h3>Insurance</h3>
<p>If you have a valid driving licence and have taken out insurance, you are insured. Even if you are unable to present the driving licence at that time. For more information, please contact your insurance company.</p>
<h3>Other countries</h3>
<p>We advise against driving in other countries during the exchange procedure. They may not be able to verify your information. And the rules and consequences may differ.</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>



  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-6102809b-db0e-4d27-ac07-898fae925298"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Surrendering a category
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-6102809b-db0e-4d27-ac07-898fae925298"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>If you no longer wish to use a category on your driving licence, you may surrender that category. You will need to complete what is known as a <a href="https://www.rdw.nl/-/media/rdwnl_en/documents/driving-licence/waiver-foreign-driving-licence.pdf?rev=b6cf8756ed3744d3885f6c6cf39b9d70&hash=E516B309249CD05D082A581AD481D3CF" download="" class="link link--primary link--download" aria-label="Download the file: waiver form"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--left" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-download"></use>
</svg><span class="link__title">waiver form</span><span class="link__extra">(pdf, 689kb)</span></a>.</p>
<h3>Getting a category back</h3>
<p>You do not lose your category indefinitely. When renewing your driving licence, the category can be reapplied to your licence. This does require you to complete <a href="/en/driving-licence/applying-or-renewing/medical-exam" class="anchor--internal-link">a Health Declaration Form</a>.</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>

  </div>
  <div class="panel-group panel-group--default">
    
  </div>

    
  </div>
</div>

  </main>

    <div class="footer-wrapper">
    <div class="grid grid--2-8-2">
      <div class="cell">
        

<section class="csat-form unprintable">
